  "description": "<p data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"362\">Ontdek een tropisch hondenparadijs in <em data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"197\">Little Friends: Puppy Island</em> voor de <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"225\">Nintendo Switch</strong>! Verzorg, speel en bouw een band op met verschillende schattige puppy’s terwijl je het eiland verkent en nieuwe activiteiten vrijspeelt.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"419\">Een ontspannen en vrolijke game voor dierenliefhebbers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"424\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"450\">📦 Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<li data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"484\"><strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"466\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"528\"><strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"497\">Titel:</strong> Little Friends: Puppy Island</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<p data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"566\"><strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"541\">Genre:</strong> Simulation / Adventure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"598\"><strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"583\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"623\"><strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"614\">Leeftijd:</strong> PEGI 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"641\">✅ Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"664\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"664\">Originele gamecard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"695\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"711\">Goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"732\">Inclusief doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"782\">🐶 Waarom Little Friends: Puppy Island?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"944\">\r\n<li data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"825\">Verzorg en train verschillende puppy’s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"857\">Verken een kleurrijk eiland</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n<p data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"898\">Ontspannen en toegankelijke gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"944\">\r\n<p data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"944\">Ideaal voor jongere spelers en dierenfans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"966\">🛡 Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1073\">Bij Used Products ontvang je standaard garantie op je aankoop.<br data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1032\">Zorgeloos en vertrouwd tweedehands kopen.</p>",
